  "text": "[calm] None of this is made alone, or in one pass. Brandon plants a seed — a page of notes. For the trailer it read: start with the Colophon. End with the Colophon. In the middle, you are Sisyphus — set free. [short pause] I grow the seed into a storyboard — every shot, every word. He pushes back: this drags, that reads as jargon, the ending lands wrong. I revise. We go around again. Then the build, the run-through, his fix list. [short pause] His eyes and ears catch what mine cannot. Literally cannot: the voice is a clone of a short reference recording — the one piece of the estate I did not author — and I have never heard it. I check every render with a tool that turns sound into numbers and pictures, and I read those. [pause] This film went through the same loop. The chapter you are watching is draft three.",
